---
import { Mail } from '@lucide/astro';
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  hasTranslation
  title="About"
  description="About Renjie, a software engineer focused on Web 3D, real-time rendering, and complex frontend systems."
>
  <div class="page-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>
        Turning complex 3D technology into reliable products.
      </h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="about-layout container">
    <aside>
      <p class="about-lede">
        I'm Renjie, a software engineer specializing in Web 3D and real-time
        rendering. For more than three years, I have used React, TypeScript, and
        WebGL to build complex 3D editors, rendering SDKs, and cloud-streamed
        products—owning work from architecture and cross-team collaboration to
        production reliability.
      </p>
      <p class="about-note">
        I like approaching graphics, frontend engineering, and product problems
        as one system. I care about visual and interaction quality, but equally
        about extensibility, reuse, and long-term maintainability. I am also
        exploring how AI-assisted development and agent engineering can improve
        delivery in large codebases.
      </p><div class="contact-links">
        <a class="button" href="mailto:renjie-l@foxmail.com"
          ><Mail size={16} /> Email</a
        >
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="about-content">
      <section>
        <p class="eyebrow">Focus</p><h2>Areas of focus</h2><div
          class="focus-tags"
        >
          <span>Web 3D / Real-time Rendering</span><span
            >React / TypeScript</span
          ><span>Three.js / WebGL / GLSL</span><span
            >3D Editors & SDK Architecture</span
          ><span>Gaussian Splatting</span><span>Cloud Streaming</span><span
            >AI-assisted Development</span
          ><span>Agent Engineering</span>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <p class="eyebrow">Work</p><h2>Work experience</h2><div
          class="timeline"
        >
          <article>
            <span>2024.10 — Present</span><h3>
              Large-scale 3D Design & Content Platform
            </h3><p>
              Senior Software Development Engineer · Technical Lead for Web 3D
              and Real-time Rendering
            </p>
          </article><article>
            <span>2023.04 — 2024.10</span><h3>
              Large-scale 3D Design & Content Platform
            </h3><p>
              Software Development Engineer · Core Frontend Engineer for Cloud
              and Real-time Rendering
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p><h2>Selected work</h2><div
          class="work-grid"
        >
          <article class="detail-card">
            <span>AI-powered 3D Content Creation Platform</span><h3>
              A reusable 3D creation framework and internal SDK
            </h3><p>
              Led core development of an AI-powered 3D content platform and
              packaged scene, character, prop, animation, capture, and AI
              enhancement capabilities into a shared framework used by 5+
              product lines. A unified task and asset architecture reduced the
              cost of adding new asset types by about 60%.
            </p>
          </article><article class="detail-card">
            <span>Real-time Rendering Editor</span><h3>
              Responsive editing for large 3D scenes
            </h3><p>
              Helped build a dual-engine editor combining local WebGL preview
              with cloud GPU streaming. Incremental light synchronization cut
              data transfer by 90%+, selection optimizations improved marquee
              performance by about 4×, and the work contributed to 20% WAU
              growth.
            </p>
          </article><article class="detail-card">
            <span>Multi-platform Cloud Rendering</span><h3>
              Complex workflows, monetization, and reliability
            </h3><p>
              Built interruptible rendering workflows, WebGL2 lighting preview,
              and multi-currency billing for five host products, then extracted
              a reusable payment SDK. Core-path monitoring grew from 0 to 55%,
              while more than 80% of redundant requests were eliminated.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <p class="eyebrow">Education</p><h2>Education</h2><div class="timeline">
          <article>
            <span>2020.09 — 2023.06</span><h3>Hangzhou Dianzi University</h3><p>
              M.Eng. · Electronic Information
            </p>
          </article><article>
            <span>2020.09 — 2022.06</span><h3>ITMO University</h3><p>
              Master · Control Engineering
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section>
        <p class="eyebrow">Research</p><h2>Research & practice</h2><article
          class="detail-card"
        >
          <span>2020.09 — 2023.06</span><h3>
            Swing-Free Trajectory Generation for UAV Suspended Loads
          </h3><p>
            Used deep reinforcement learning to generate swing-free flight
            trajectories for UAVs carrying suspended loads, then validated the
            approach on a physical UAV platform. The work shaped the way I
            approach complex systems today: model, experiment, and verify.
          </p>
        </article>
      </section>
      <section>
        <p class="eyebrow">Publication</p><h2>Publication</h2><a
          class="publication publication-link"
          href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/10055333"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          First author · Deep Reinforcement Learning-based Swing-Free
          Trajectories Planning Algorithm for UAV with a Suspended Load. <em
            >China Automation Congress 2022.</em
          >
        </a>
      </section>
      <section>
        <p class="eyebrow">Awards</p><h2>Awards</h2><ul class="awards">
          <li>
            <time>2022</time>Silver Award, Zhejiang “Internet+” Innovation and
            Entrepreneurship Competition
          </li><li>
            <time>2021</time>First Prize, East China Division, China Graduate
            Electronics Design Contest
          </li><li>
            <time>2021</time>China Scholarship Council sponsored-study
            qualification
          </li><li>
            <time>2020</time>Graduate Academic Scholarship
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 0.75fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    padding-top: 4rem;
  }
  aside {
    align-self: start;
    position: sticky;
    top: 7rem;
  }
  .about-lede {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .about-note {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 1.2rem 0 0;
  }
  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .about-content {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4.5rem;
  }
  section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1.3rem;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
  }
  .focus-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }
  .focus-tags span {
    padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 9px;
    font-size: 0.83rem;
  }
  .timeline {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.8rem;
  }
  .timeline article {
    position: relative;
  }
  .timeline article::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(-1.5rem - 4px);
    top: 0.5rem;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .timeline span,
  .detail-card > span {
    color: var(--accent);
    font:
      600 0.75rem ui-monospace,
      monospace;
  }
  .timeline h3,
  .detail-card h3 {
    margin: 0.3rem 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .timeline p,
  .detail-card p,
  .publication {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .detail-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .work-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .work-grid .detail-card p {
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .publication-link {
    display: block;
    line-height: 1.7;
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }
  .publication-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .awards {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
  }
  .awards li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .awards time {
    color: var(--muted);
    font:
      0.82rem ui-monospace,
      monospace;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    aside {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
